  "BR/BR-001-business.md": "---\nid: BR-001\ntitle: Business\npurpose: Why.\nstatus: Approved\ncreated: 2026-09-01\nupdated: 2026-09-01\n---\n\n# BR-001 — Business\n\n- **BR-001-R001** — A business requirement.\n",
  "PR/PR-001-product.md": "---\nid: PR-001\ntitle: Product\npurpose: What.\nstatus: Approved\ncreated: 2026-09-01\nupdated: 2026-09-01\n---\n\n# PR-001 — Product\n\n## References\n\n### Derived From\n- [BR-001](../BR/BR-001-business.md)\n\n## Requirements\n\n- **PR-001-R001** — First.\n- **PR-001-R002** — Second.\n",
  "Stories/US-001-export-report.md": "---\nid: US-001\ntitle: Export report\npurpose: Let users export a weekly report.\nstatus: Draft\ncreated: 2026-09-01\nupdated: 2026-09-01\ndelivery_status: Not Started\ncovers: [PR-001-R001]\n---\n\n# US-001 — Export report\n\n## References\n\n### Derived From\n- [PR-001](../PR/PR-001-product.md)\n\n## Story\n\nAs a user, I want to export a report, so that I can share it.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n1. **Given** data, **when** I export, **then** a file is produced.\n\n## Notes\n\nKeep it simple.\n",
  "Stories/US-002-archive-old.md": "---\nid: US-002\ntitle: Archive old\npurpose: Archive stale items.\nstatus: Draft\ncreated: 2026-09-01\nupdated: 2026-09-01\ndelivery_status: Not Started\ncovers: []\n---\n\n# US-002 — Archive old\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n1. **Given** stale items, **when** archiving runs, **then** they are archived.\n"
